description: "UEF/Cybran/Aeon/Seraphim-inspired artillery, defence and industry. 2.5 stage 3: T6 Seraphim — Requiem artillery, Obelisk beam, Seraphim Net, Chronofield, Seraphim Dome, antimatter industry, Annihilation Reactor, singular shells. Stage 2: T5 Aeon. 2.5 stage 1: T4 — Monolith strategic artillery (heat-fed), Bastion railgun, Suppressor EMP, Citadel shield; iridite, tritium ice, iridium, superconductor, liquid nitrogen; cryocondenser, iridium smelter, superconductor chamber, plasma heater, fusion reactor. 2.0: T1-T3 arsenal, BKM cores and ACUs."
